msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:676
msgid "The company behind WooCommerce actively promotes its add-ons, plugins, and extensions. They also affect the emails you receive from your webshop. This behavior can be seen as annoying or nagging by some users. Use the option below to stay balanced."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:687
msgid "Remove the \"Get the app\" from WooCommerce emails footer"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:689
msgid "WooCommerce is adding its own prompts to the footer of emails sent to the shop's admin. Enable this option to get rid of the annoying text in your emails."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:699
msgid "Disable WooCommerce guide email notifications"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:700
msgid "WooCommerce sends email notifications with additional guidance to complete the Store Setup. Enable this option to block this behavior and stop sending these emails."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:707
msgid "Speed up your site by turning off unwanted scripts that are being loaded in the background in admin panel."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:716
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Status Meta Box"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:717
msgid "Enabling this option will remove WooCommerce Status Meta Box from WordPress Dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:727
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Dashboard Setup Widget"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:728
msgid "Enabling this option will remove WooCommerce Dashboard Setup Widget from WordPress Dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:740
msgid "This option allows you to disable the new WooCommerce product editor, which is currently in beta and disabled by default (opt-in)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:751
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Blocks (back-end)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:753
msgid "Activating this option will disable WooCommerce Blocks scripts from loading in the admin panel. The WordPress Block Editor will load and run faster, but WooCommerce Blocks won't be available to add from the Block Editor level."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:760
msgid "By default, quite a lot of scripts and styles are automatically loading while browsing the front-end of your shop. Use the options below to disable them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:769
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Widgets"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:770
msgid "WooCommerce by default comes with a lot of widgets installed. They often are not used at all, but can add backend load and front-end load. Use this option to disable the WooCommerce widgets. <strong>Warning:</strong> Please make sure that you are not using any of WooCommerce Widgets anywhere in your site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:780
msgid "Disable WooCommerce scripts and styles"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:781
msgid "Use this option to disable WooCommerce scripts (javascript) and styles (CSS) everywhere except on product, cart and checkout pages."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:791
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Cart Fragments"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:792
msgid "The cart fragments feature is used to update the cart total without refreshing the page. <strong>Warning:</strong> Disabling it will speed up your store, but may result in wrong calculations in mini cart. Use with caution."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:803
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Blocks (front-end)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:805
msgid "WooCommerce Blocks module loads tons of CSS files (200 KB) in your site front-end. Activating this option will turn off loading the WooCommerce Blocks in your store and should improve page loading speed. If you are using any of the Blocks, they won't display correctly after enabling this option. The Cart and Checkout pages always keep their block styles, so your store can still take orders."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:816
msgid "Disable unnecessary Stripe scripts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:818
msgid "Enabling this option will disable Stripe Payment Request Button on all product pages. The Stripe scripts won't be loaded on the product pages so the pages should be loading faster."
