msgid "Meta Generator Tag displays the WordPress & WooCommerce version number. Removing the meta generator tag protects you against attacks and may reduce your web page's size. Use this option to disable the Meta Tag generated by WordPress, WooCommerce, and many other plugins that hook up with the wp_generator action."
