msgid "Prevents the WordPress core feature known as wp-embed from loading on your website. The wp-embed feature allows you to embed videos, images, tweets, and other types of content from various platforms by pasting a URL into the WordPress editor. While this feature can be useful, it can also slow down your site's loading times, increase your server resources usage, and pose potential security risks."
msgstr ""

